{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:03 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:03 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:03 2026-10-19 HKT</p><p>馬斯克在其X平台帳號宣布，將於明年向全美每一位孩子(every kid)贈送一份我的SpaceX股份。馬斯克並稱：「這只是未來一系列行動中的第一步。」</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67a1f6f1371b146eb3a7f345e58f8762/2026-10/b71b-1e62d1a97c8d1ba11ee71be3b5337685.png\"/><p>SpaceX現價每股145.49美元，折合約1,131港元。該股現市值逼2萬億美元，馬斯克持有 約 48% 股權，並透過每股表決權為普通股 10 倍的 B 類股，掌握約 82% 表決權。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:19:54.158023+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:03:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:17:49.712593+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:17:49.712593+00:00","content_hash":"e2fe6221c3d4f0efc80201c21ab953c5e42f71dd1e9c9bcb8923e0794e1286ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}